  era: "Section 16 \xB7 Mughal Empire \xB7 1526 \u2013 1857"
  title: Mughal administration
  text: The emperor ruled through ministers such as the wakil, diwan, mir bakhshi and sadr. The empire was divided into provinces called subas, then sarkars and parganas, with Persian as the language of government.
